1
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:22,200
Once you have completed your work, you will need to decontaminate all of the materials inside of the BSC and the BSC itself.
完成工作后，你需要对生物安全柜内的所有材料以及生物安全柜本身进行去污。

2
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,200
This is all done while the blower motor is on.
这些都要在风机开着的情况下进行。

3
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,200
The first thing that needs to be done is close all the containers.
首先要做的是盖好所有容器。

4
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:41,200
Next, using the same disinfectant used to clean the cabinet before work started, generously apply disinfectant to the materials in the cabinet.
接下来，使用工作开始前清洁安全柜时所用的同一种消毒剂，充分地涂抹在柜内的材料上。

5
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:52,200
This can be done directly to the materials or by moistening a towel and wiping the surface of the materials, starting with the least contaminated items first.
可以直接涂在材料上，也可以润湿一张纸巾擦拭材料表面，先从污染最轻的物品开始。

6
00:00:52,200 --> 00:01:04,200
Please note, samples should be surface decontaminated or placed into secondary containers that have been surface decontaminated prior to exiting the cabinet.
请注意，样品在移出安全柜之前，应进行表面去污，或者放入已经过表面去污的二级容器中。

7
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:09,200
Please allow materials to remain wetted for the appropriate amount of contact time.
请让材料保持湿润，达到适当的接触时间。

8
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:35,790
After the appropriate contact time is passed, remove any residual wetness and place the materials that will remain in the cabinet on the designated clean side of the cabinet.
经过适当的接触时间后，擦去残留的水分，把要留在柜内的材料放到柜内指定的清洁侧。

9
00:01:35,790 --> 00:01:45,790
If a blue absorbent pad was used, discard it into the biohazardous waste container by grabbing the outer corners of the pad and folding it inward.
如果使用了蓝色吸水垫，抓住吸水垫的外角向内折叠，把它丢进生物危害废物容器。

10
00:01:45,790 --> 00:02:02,630
Other materials from the BSC, placing them on your cart.
把生物安全柜中的其他材料取出，放到你的推车上。

11
00:02:02,630 --> 00:02:14,970
After removing everything from the cabinet that needs to come out, proceed to decontaminate the inner surfaces of the BSC as you did before beginning work.
把柜内需要拿出来的东西全部取出后，像开始工作前那样，对生物安全柜的内表面进行去污。

12
00:02:14,970 --> 00:02:19,970
Don't forget the sides and back wall as well as the inside of the glass sash.
别忘了侧壁和后壁，以及玻璃前窗的内侧。

13
00:02:19,970 --> 00:02:29,970
To remove the biohazardous waste bag or container, moisten a paper towel with disinfectant and carefully wipe the outside of the bag and or waste pan.
要取出生物危害废物袋或容器时，用消毒剂润湿一张纸巾，小心地擦拭废物袋和／或废物盘的外表面。

14
00:02:29,970 --> 00:02:51,460
Dispose of the paper towels and gloves. Allow for the appropriate amount of contact time.
丢弃纸巾和手套。留出适当的接触时间。

15
00:02:51,460 --> 00:03:02,380
Next, add the recommended amount of water to the biohazard bag and then loosely gather the opening of the biohazard bag and loosely tape it.
接下来，往生物危害废物袋中加入建议量的水，然后把袋口松松地收拢，用胶带松松地封上。

16
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:11,660
The reason you loosely closed it is because you don't want it completely sealed when it goes into the autoclave.
之所以要松松地封口，是因为放进高压灭菌器时，你不希望它是完全密封的。

17
00:03:12,660 --> 00:03:19,660
If it is, then the steam will not be able to penetrate the bag and the contents may not be decontaminated.
如果完全密封，蒸汽就无法穿透袋子，里面的东西可能就无法被去污。

18
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:27,660
If only a biohazard bag was used, remove the bag and place it into a waste pan outside of the BSC for autoclaving.
如果只用了生物危害废物袋，就把袋子取出，放到生物安全柜外的废物盘中进行高压灭菌。

19
00:03:27,660 --> 00:03:33,660
If a bag and a waste pan were used, remove both from the BSC.
如果同时用了废物袋和废物盘，就把两者都从生物安全柜中取出。

20
00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:38,660
Leave the blower motor running for at least four more minutes to purge the air.
让风机再运行至少四分钟，以清除空气中的污染物。

21
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:43,660
After four minutes, turn off the lights and blower and close the sash.
四分钟后，关闭照明灯和风机，并关上前窗。

22
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:55,860
If you have a UV light, you may or may not turn it on, as per your SOPs.
如果有紫外灯，可以根据你们的 SOP 决定是否打开。

23
00:03:55,860 --> 00:04:01,860
Some labs will leave their BSC blower motor running continuously.
有些实验室会让生物安全柜的风机一直运行。

24
00:04:01,860 --> 00:04:06,860
In that case, you could turn off the light but leave the sash open.
这种情况下，你可以关掉照明灯，但让前窗保持打开。

25
00:04:06,860 --> 00:04:11,860
If your lab keeps a usage log, be sure to sign the BSC log form.
如果你们实验室有使用记录，一定要在生物安全柜使用记录表上签名。

26
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:13,860
One final note.
最后再说一点。

27
00:04:13,860 --> 00:04:18,860
Each lab should have established schedules and SOPs for routine cleaning
每个实验室都应制定日常清洁的时间安排和 SOP，

28
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:22,860
and any routine maintenance not requiring an outside contractor.
以及不需要外部承包商的日常维护的时间安排和 SOP。

29
00:04:22,860 --> 00:04:29,860
Non-routine maintenance repairs will be handled by a contractor designated by the safety office.
非日常的维护维修将由安全办公室指定的承包商负责。

30
00:04:29,860 --> 00:04:37,860
Laboratory staff members should be aware of their responsibilities and establish policies necessary to maintain the BSCs.
实验室工作人员应了解自己的职责，并制定维护生物安全柜所需的制度。

31
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:41,860
And they should consult the safety office for any needed guidance.
如需任何指导，应咨询安全办公室。
